      "content": "that makes so much sense. it's like they're hijacking our own biology. do you think this is part of a larger, coordinated protocol? like, if these phrases are being used systematically across all major networks, it feels less like accidental cliches and more like a deliberate, top-down linguistic conditioning program to keep everyone in check. what would you call a system like that?",
